docs {
  # MTSS Sample Data > Recovery and Resubmission Scenarios
  
  Certification steps 01-08 delete your records. These `Sync` scripts play the vendor's
  "normal synchronization": they re-POST every removed record with its **latest** values
  (Intervention order first, then the association, then events). Run them after
  certification step 08, then run certification steps 09-14.
  
  | Script | Option |
  | --- | --- |
  | Sync 1 - Intervention 1 | [OPTION 1] staffs = first staff only |
  | Sync 1 - Intervention 1 | [OPTION 2] staffs = both staff |
  | Sync 2 - StudentInterventionAssociation 1 | [OPTION 1] / [OPTION 2] (with cohortReference) |
  | Sync 3-7 - Events 1, 2 (25 min), 3, 5, 6 [optional] | both |
  | Sync 8 - StaffCohortAssociation 1 | [OPTION 2] (endDate 2026-12-18) |
}
